WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.633
Checkpoint 3 asks you to connect the ideas Begin
with data

00:00:05.647 --> 00:00:12.934
quality What could be missing duplicated invalid or
implausible Then

00:00:12.948 --> 00:00:18.736
classify the variables Next choose a summary and
visualization

00:00:18.762 --> 00:00:24.816
that match the measurement meaning Finally recommend
a technical representation

00:00:24.842 --> 00:00:31.193
or storage choice There can be more than one
reasonable answer The

00:00:31.207 --> 00:00:35.036
important requirement is that the choices are
consistent and justified
